::  modules/tablecloth/glow/gate-tablecloth-fk.glow -- Foreign-key gate!
/!  16384
|%
++  gate-tablecloth-fk
  |=  [parent-exists=@ud amount=@ud]                    ::  1=found, 0=absent
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  committed amount
  ~|  'tablecloth-foreign-key-missing'                  ::  referential law!
  ?>  (eql parent-exists 1)                             ::  parent PK exists
  ~|  'tablecloth-zero-amount-refused'                  ::  non-zero entry
  ?>  (gte amount 1)
  amount
--
